mes is either a manager and appears in the company today or neither a manager nor appears in the company today.**.\n   - This means James is in one of two states:.\n     - He is a manager and appears in the company today.\n     - He is not a manager and does not appear in the company today.\nJames does not have lunch in the company.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
