e legs" does not provide enough information to definitively conclude whether KiKi is terricolous or not. It only tells us that if KiKi jumps and has legs, then KiKi must not be terricolous or have legs. But since we do not have information about whether KiKi has legs or jumps, we cannot determine if KiKi is terricolous.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "KiKi is terricolous" is **certain**.\n\nThe correct answer is:\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
