messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAll Romance languages are Indo-European languages. The Romance languages are a language family. All languages within a language family are related to each other. French and Spanish are both Romance languages. German is related to Spanish. Basque is not related to any other language.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Basque is a Romance language.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', "Let's break down the information given and analyze the statement step by step:.\n\n1.**All Romance languages are Indo-European languages.**.\n   - This tells us that Romance languages are a subset of Indo-European languages.\n\n2.**The Romance languages are a language family.**.\n   - This means Romance languages share a common ancestor and are related to each other.\n\n3.**All languages within a language family are related to each other.**.\n   - This reinforces that Romance languages are related to each other.\n\n4.**French and Spanish are both Romance languages.**.\n   - This gives us specific examples of Romance languages.\n\n5.**German is related to Spanish.**.\n   - This indicates that German and Spanish share a common ancestor, but it does not necessarily mean German is a Romance language.German is part of the Germanic branch of the Indo-European language family.Basque is a Romance language.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
