messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nNo digital media are analog. Every printed text is analog. All streaming services are digital. If an object is a hardcover book then it is printed text. If 1984 is a streaming service, then 1984 is a hardcover book.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? 1984 is a streaming service.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', 'To solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the given information and analyze the statement step by step.\n\n1.**No digital media are analog.**.\n   - This means that if something is digital, it cannot be analog, and vice versa.\n\n2.**Every printed text is analog.**.\n   - This means that all printed texts fall under the category of analog media.\n\n3.**All streaming services are digital.**.\n   - This means that if something is a streaming service, it must be digital.\n\n4.**If an object is a hardcover book then it is printed text.**.\n   - This means that all hardcover books are printed texts, and thus analog (from point 2).\n\n5.**If 1984 is a streaming service, then 1984 is a hardcover book.**.\n   - This is a conditional statement.If 1984 is a streaming service, it must also be a hardcover book.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze the statement "1984 is a streaming service.".The statement "1984 is a streaming service" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
