nsequently, she would not have downloaded it.\n- Since Karen did download "Black Mirror", it follows that "Black Mirror" must be popular.\n\nThus, the statement "Black Mirror" is popular is true.\n\nThe correct answer is:\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
