e high school dances.**.\n   - This means inactive and disinterested people are chaperones.\n\n5.**All young children and teenagers who wish to further their academic careers and educational opportunities are students who attend the school.**.\n   - This means those who wish to further their academic careers are students.\n\n6.Bonnie rarely participates in school talent shows.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
