 statement also asserts that koalas are quokka. As per the provided information, koalas and quokka are identical animals. Therefore, koalas can be quokka.\n\nHence, the statement "Koalas hate to sleep and are not quokka" is true because while koalas do hate to sleep, they are indeed quokka.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
