messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAll mammals are animals. All monkeys are mammals. An animal is either a monkey or a bird. All birds fly. All animals breathe. If something can fly, then it has wings. If Rock is neither a fly nor a bird, then Rock neither flies nor breathes.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Rock has wings.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', "To solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the information given and analyze the statement about Rock step by step.\n\n1.**All mammals are animals.**.\n   - This means that if something is a mammal, it is also an animal.\n\n2.**All monkeys are mammals.**.\n   - This means that if something is a monkey, it is also a mammal and, by extension, an animal.\n\n3.**An animal is either a monkey or a bird.**.\n   - This means that if something is an animal, it must be either a monkey or a bird.There are no other types of animals in this context.\n\n4.**All birds fly.**.\n   - This means that if something is a bird, it can fly.\n\n5.**All animals breathe.**.\n   - This means that if something is an animal, it can breathe.\n\n6.**If something can fly, then it has wings.**.\n   - This means that if something can fly, it must have wings.\nIf Rock is both a fly and a bird, then Rock both flies and breathes.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
